nvda-rdp-linux (0.5.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Server: NVDA's driver settings, as RDAccess's remote driver: NVDA's
    voices in Orca, and the new nvda-rdp-settings command to read and
    change the settings of NVDA's synthesizer and braille display.
  * Server: contracted braille typing with Orca's contraction table;
    display gestures resolved in NVDA's order, model bindings included;
    braille modifier toggles.
  * Server: braille size from rows and columns; a removed display is
    reported to Orca; a channel attaching again forgets the previous
    client's attributes.
  * Server: timeSinceInput answered on both channels from Mutter's idle
    time.
  * Server: pause at Speech Dispatcher's next sentence mark; sound icons
    and Orca's capital icon played by NVDA; SSML languages and breaks
    within a message.
  * Client: Orca's words spoken in one message, without a pause between
    words, when the server is this project's.
  * Caps Lock is not synchronized by the server (documented).

 -- Patrick Cressant <patrick.cressant@gmail.com>  Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:43:14 +0100

nvda-rdp-linux (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Braille between this project's client and server: the client pushes the
    display size after its protocol version, as RDAccess's handler does, and
    the server asks for it when the channel is ready, as RDAccess's remote
    braille driver does. Before, each waited for the other and Orca's
    braille never reached a Linux client.

 -- Patrick Cressant <patrick.cressant@gmail.com>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 20:46:16 +0100

nvda-rdp-linux (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New server side: NVDA on Windows, with RDAccess and mstsc, speaks and
    shows the braille of Orca in a GNOME 49+ session served by GNOME
    Remote Desktop, the remote login screen included.
  * Split into nvda-rdp-common, nvda-rdp-freerdp-plugin, nvda-rdp-client
    and nvda-rdp-server.
  * Client: remote braille kept through Remmina's full screen, BrlAPI
    priority 80, remote speech stopped when the RDP client loses focus,
    plugin reconnection, spoken content logged at DEBUG only.
  * Man pages nvda-rdp-client(1) and nvda-rdp-server(7), with French
    translations.

 -- Patrick Cressant <patrick.cressant@gmail.com>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:14:08 +0100
